==Description==
The '''Ocean Nametag''' is a {{Color|Rare}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|2,000}}.

The '''Ocean Nametag''' has text which has a blue to dark blue gradient and a black outline.

==Trivia==
*The description of the '''Ocean Nametag''' is a reference to the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tkzY_VwNIek Ocean Man] song made by Ween.

